#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_secure_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"Aucune marque de transfert sécurisé n'est configurée : le lien n'aurait pas "
"de domaine où vivre."
msgstr ""
"No secure-transfer brand is configured: the link would have no domain to "
"live on."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_organisation__secure_otp_channel
msgid "Canal du code de la remise sécurisée"
msgstr "Channel for the delivery code"

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_attestation__secure_frozen_attachment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_charge_statement__secure_frozen_attachment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_disclosure__secure_frozen_attachment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_secure_delivery__secure_frozen_attachment_id
msgid ""
"Ce qui est parti, tel quel. Le transfert efface la sienne ; celle-ci reste, "
"parce qu'une pièce régénérée plus tard ne dirait pas la même chose."
msgstr ""
"What went out, as it was. The transfer erases its own copy; this one "
"remains, because a document regenerated later would not say the same thing."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_charge_statement.py:0
msgid ""
"Cet état n'est pas encore fourni. Le préavis au propriétaire est une "
"condition de l'autorisation (art. 1069 al. 2), et le module le vérifie à la "
"remise."
msgstr ""
"This statement is not yet provided. Prior notice to the owner is a condition"
" of the authorization (art. 1069 para. 2), and the module checks it at "
"delivery."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_secure_mixin.py:0
msgid "Cette pièce est déjà partie par transfert sécurisé le %s."
msgstr "This document already went out by secure transfer on %s."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_attestation__secure_frozen_attachment_id
