#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_secure_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"Votre compte n'a pas d'adresse courriel : l'accusé d'envoi n'aurait nulle "
"part où aller."
msgstr ""
"Your account has no email address: the delivery receipt would have nowhere "
"to go."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_charge_statement.py:0
msgid "« %s » est annulé."
msgstr "\"%s\" is cancelled."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_attestation.py:0
msgid "« %s » est annulée : elle n'a pas à être remise."
msgstr "\"%s\" is cancelled: it does not have to be delivered."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_disclosure.py:0
msgid "« %s » est annulée."
msgstr "\"%s\" is cancelled."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_securetransfer.model_bf_property_charge_statement
msgid "État des charges communes dues"
msgstr "Statement of common expenses due"

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_securetransfer/models/bf_property_charge_statement.py:0
msgid "État des charges communes dues : %s"
msgstr "Statement of common expenses due: %s"

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_attestation__secure_unread
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_charge_statement__secure_unread
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_disclosure__secure_unread
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_secure_delivery__secure_unread
msgid ""
"⚠️ Le lien a expiré et personne ne l'a ouvert. Le syndicat a envoyé ; "
"l'acquéreur n'a rien reçu. Sur l'art. 1069 al. 2, dont le délai joue contre "
"le syndicat, la différence n'est pas théorique."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ The link expired and nobody opened it. The syndicate sent; the acquirer "
"received nothing. On art. 1069 para. 2, whose period runs against the "
"syndicate, the difference is not theoretical."

#. module: bf_property_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_securetransfer.field_bf_property_organisation__secure_otp_channel
msgid ""
"⚠️ Par courriel, le lien et le code arrivent dans la même boîte : qui accède"
" à cette boîte accède aux documents. Par texto, il faut les deux, mais le "
"mobile doit être inscrit à la fiche du destinataire, sans quoi le socle "
"bascule sur le courriel."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ By email, the link and the code arrive in the same mailbox: whoever "
"reaches that mailbox reaches the documents. By text message both are needed,"
" but the mobile must be on the recipient's record, failing which the base "
"falls back to email."
